<title>USA: Intel Corp raises payout.</title>
<headline>Intel Corp raises payout.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.06		     $0.05</p>
